### Year Tests:

### Post blog with valid year:  Expected result: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "First Class Blog with Year",
  "author": "Paul Mayer",
  "url": "https://fullstackopen.com",
  "year": 2024
}

### Post blog with invalid year (too old). Expected: 400 Bad Request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Too Old Blog",
  "author": "Paul Mayer",
  "url": "https://fullstackopen.com",
  "year": 1989
}

### Post blog with invalid year (future). Expected: 400 Bad Request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Back to the Future Blog",
  "author": "Paul Mayer",
  "url": "https://fullstackopen.com",
  "year": 2030
}

